照，开发者可以上手试试这版，帮忙在正式发布前踩掉最后的坑。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">270614230fa813bad205fa25ab925543ee01d8e8</guid><source url="https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-beta-5">Godot 引擎博客</source></item><item><title>为英国学校做游戏化学习模块：开工前的预生产清单</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/building-a-game-based-learning-module-for-uk-schools-a-pre-production-checklist-1p7e</link><description>给英国学校做游戏化学习模块，成败往往在写代码之前就定了，这份预生产清单帮小团队先把课时、设备、课程标准与数据合规这些硬约束理清楚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:50:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6b0761ff3325ea4ea3b9d79b55014b1c5c2fd222</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/building-a-game-based-learning-module-for-uk-schools-a-pre-production-checklist-1p7e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了个本地高斯泼溅转游戏网格工具，改成一次性买断而不做订阅</title><link>https://dev.to/stephen487/i-built-a-local-gaussian-splat-to-game-mesh-converter-and-sold-it-as-a-one-off-instead-of-a-29l8</link><description>作者把高斯泼溅点云转成带贴图、碰撞体和两档 LOD 的游戏可用网格，做成本地运行的一次性买断小工具，并分享了这条变现路线的取舍。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:08:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f85a2fd1d8f7514362a163aa04859895aa2f605d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/stephen487/i-built-a-local-gaussian-splat-to-game-mesh-converter-and-sold-it-as-a-one-off-instead-of-a-29l8">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用文字提示设计音效的实用工作流</title><link>https://dev.to/sfxv3_audio/a-practical-workflow-for-designing-sound-effects-from-text-prompts-5d7m</link><description>从一句清晰的文字描述出发，先生成、再聆听、再细化提示词，这篇文章给出了一套用文本提示做游戏音效的实操流程，适合想快速出音效原型的独立开发者。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:54:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e10ab21f363b017103eb65064cc3a6571b1e3e1d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/sfxv3_audio/a-practical-workflow-for-designing-sound-effects-from-text-prompts-5d7m">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>俄罗斯要搞游戏版号？考虑强制游戏许可，并允许安全局获取玩家数据</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607139</link><descript